OL,3,GNEWSAPets 'so important' for homeless
OL,4,
OL,5,FA charity that helps homeless people
OL,6,Fcare for their pets says the animals
OL,7,Foften provide the "only thing in their
OL,8,Flife that gives them any stability".
OL,10,FFree veterinary treatment is provided
OL,11,Fto people struggling to access care for
OL,12,Ftheir animals by StreetVet volunteers.
OL,14,FOne pet owner, at an outreach centre in
OL,15,FPenzance, Cornwall, said he did not
OL,16,Fknow what he would have done without
OL,17,Fthe charity. StreetVet Cornwall also
OL,18,Fhas outreach clinics in Truro,
OL,19,FFalmouth, Redruth, St Austell and
OL,20,FNewquay.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
